nd give audiences the  closure they deserve likewise he gave  some hints as to what the movie will be  like accordingly it will be huge of  course but above all it will be gloomy  and a little different from what some  fans might expect this is certainly  associated with the death of one or more  characters which is in line with an  earlier interview with nebula actress  karen gillian in said interview with  yahoo movies she claimed she actually  had to cry while reading through the  script on may 5th 2023 we will know more  because that's when guardians of the  galaxy vol 3 is scheduled to be released  in theaters  one topic in particular dominated the  film world at the end of last week and  that was the casting of jason momoa for  the upcoming fast and furious 10. while  nothing is known about the plot of the  penultimate fast and furious installment  there are at least a few theories as to  what role aquaman star mamoa might take  on the most persistent rumor is that  momoa will be playing the bad guy  well at least that's what deadline  claims but they also admit to simply not  having enough information on this script  at this point the second option would be  casting him as a protagonist alongside  vin diesel thus a role similar to the  one dwayne johnson held as luke hopps  well we would not like to comment on  which version is more likely at this  time either way one person should be  particularly pleased and that is dwayne  johnson after all following his dispute  with vin diesel he was literally pleaded  to return to the franchise and bring it  to a nice harmonious end momoa at least  in contrast to the often controversial  vin diesel is considered a fan favorite  and is likely not only to balloon the  production budget with his feet but he  may also be the anti-thesis of dom  toretto who has been repeatedly called  for since lukhov's split fast and  furious 10 is set for release on may 19  2023  the loki series on disney plus opened up  the multiverse which is so important for  phase 4 of the mcu and thus it also  paved the way for movies like spiderman  no way home or the upcoming doctor  strange and the multiverse of madness  now barely a year after the release of  the first season the second season is  already to be shot as the portal  backstage reports filming is scheduled  to start as early as this summer with  pinewood studios neal london being the  shooting location no longer involved  will be director k herron who had  already ruled out a new commitment in  advance which probably was due to the  very late communication of season 2. we  hope that at least in front of the  camera familiar faces like own wilson or  google mathera will be back should they  be able to stick to the schedule we will  get to watch the second season on disney  plus at the beginning of 2023  foundation is definitely one of the  bigger names on the apple tv plus  streaming service the science fiction  series revolves around a story taking  place in the future where humanity is no  longer confined to earth but scattered  across many different planets throughout  the galaxy at the top of the food chain  is the so-called galactic empire which  governs the various human colonies the  first season mainly centered around four  characters who try to do their utmost to  secure the future of the human species  in extremely unstable times thus all  must be done to counter the collapse of  the galaxy and for this purpose the  so-called foundation was established by  dr harry selden the cast around jared  harris lee pace lou lavelle and leah  harvey is now growing a lot for season  2. let us introduce you to a few new  characters first there's dimitri  leonida's playing hobart mallow he's a  cunning merchant operating according to  his very own morals and wants nothing  more than to ply his trade in addition  there's bel rios who's embodied by ben  daniels he's the last great general of  the superliminal fleet and as a soldier  he's naturally committed mainly to the  galactic empire although this trust  seems to be dwindling evermore isabella  loveland on the other hand plays the  cheerful cleric brother constant who  spreads her teachings throughout the  galactic empire and is a thoroughly  convinced believer in her faith her  counterpart is the cleric paulie varies  of who besides his drinking problem is  utterly cynical and has a razor sharp  mind he is portrayed by kolvinder gear  there's also sandra yes and sendaiver as  anjonaroo who is an advisor to crane  cereth who in turn will be played by  lray smith the queen in particular will  make clever use of her role as the  underdog especially since she has a  great vendetta planned besides the  actors just mentioned holt mckellen  michael pursebrand rachel house and  nimrod carr will also be joining the  cast sadly it is not yet known when  exactly foundation season 2 will be  released on apple tv plus  as every year the world is looking  forward to the most important sports  event of the year the 2022 super bowl  between the los angeles rams and the  cincinnati bengals the finale of the nfl  will not only feature a top class  halftime show by eminem snoop dogg mary  j blige kendrick lamar and dr dre but  also all kinds of new trailers for  upcoming movies and series at last year  super bowl movie fans were rather  disappointed as theaters were still  closed in many major locations like los  angeles and new york city this year  things are also unusually quiet as far  as rumors from the major studios are  concerned however that doesn't mean that  we cannot expect any surprises for one  thing there's universal which is  traditionally one of the more active  studios at the super bowl just think  about the miami appearance back then  when the fast and furious knight trailer  was phenomenally supported by  performances from various artists  involved in the film this year we expect  to see new material on jurassic world  dominion and minions the rise of crew as